text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M02_Text_0817C937 {
    "I want to raise a POKéMON that’s\nthe ultimate in “great” for both\lbattles and CONTESTS.\pIt’s vexing, trying to figure out\nwhich moves I should make it learn."
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M02_Text_0817C9D5 {
    "Do any of your friends have any\nBERRIES?\pYou can use that BERRY BLENDER and\nmake オカキクケS with your friends!\pYou should try it - it’s a lot of fun!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M02_Text_0817CA67 {
    "I have two, so you can have one!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M02_Text_0817CA88 {
    "Make オカキクケS and put them in there.\pWhen you make a オカキクケ, everyone\nhas to put in a different BERRY."
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M02_Text_0817CAEC {
    "If you win a CONTEST, they put up a\nposter of your POKéMON on the wall.\pIt will have a portrait of your\nPOKéMON and both your names."
}
